  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Nucleus P and nucleus Q undergo nuclear fusion to create nucleus R. The nuclear binding energy per nucleon for P is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}}\"></span> and for R is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span>. </p>\n<p>What is true about the relationship between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span> and about fusion in the core of main sequence stars?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>Relationship between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span></strong></td>\n<td><strong>Fusion in the core of main sequence stars</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}} &gt; B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span></td>\n<td>hydrogen fuses into helium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}} &lt; B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span></td>\n<td>hydrogen fuses into helium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}} &gt; B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span></td>\n<td>helium fuses into larger elements</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{\\textup{P}} &lt; B_{\\textup{R}}\"></span></td>\n<td>helium fuses into larger elements</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>"
  },
